SIVE), Pick and Draw \n- Play alongside NPC personalities including Smoking Martha! \n- Never pay for credits or sit around waiting for a time-based deposit, when you run out you can add more for free \n- Stats for how well you play over time (complete with a fancy graph)", "short_description": "Enjoy one of the most beloved casino games from the comfort of your home. Video Poker VR features all-you-can-play Jacks or Better video poker along with five other game modes. With classics likes Deuces Wild and Aces and Eights along with a new mode \"Five Fives\" you'll find a game you'll love to sit down and chill playing."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.videopokervr.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://www.videopokervr.com/terms-of-use/", "publisher_name": "Experience VR Games", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.videopokervr.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["SIMULATION", "CASUAL", "STRATEGY"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "465687005230076"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 2, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "357041925011798"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "492740961248696"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "492740961248696"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1562000400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "357041925011798"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2